# Environment variables — Freedom Paws

Copy to `.env.local` for local production testing, or set in Vercel/hosting dashboard.

```bash
# preview = blocks search engines, shows private banner (use until LLC/TM launch)
# public = normal indexing when you are ready to announce
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_MODE=preview

# Admin login for /admin/symptoms symptom lexicon review
ADMIN_PASSWORD=your-strong-password-here
```

## Site URLs (Framer ↔ app — P0)

```bash
# App PWA base — set when app.freedompawsinc.com DNS is live on Vercel
# Until then: https://YOUR-PROJECT.vercel.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://app.freedompawsinc.com

# Framer marketing site (defaults to https://freedompawsinc.com if unset)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FRAMER_URL=https://freedompawsinc.com

# Optional — override if Framer page slugs differ
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FRAMER_GRANTS_URL=https://freedompawsinc.com/grants
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FRAMER_MISSION_URL=https://freedompawsinc.com/mission
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FRAMER_VETERANS_URL=https://freedompawsinc.com/veterans
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FRAMER_SHELTERS_URL=https://freedompawsinc.com/shelters
```

## ViT / AI

```bash
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_VISION_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=
```

## Xaman / XRPL checkout (P1 — primary payment rail)

```bash
# API key — you may already have NEXT_PUBLIC_XUMM_API_KEY on Vercel
NEXT_PUBLIC_XUMM_API_KEY=
XUMM_API_KEY=
# REQUIRED server-side secret (never expose to browser)
XUMM_API_SECRET=

# Where protocol payments are sent (your XRPL r-address)
XRPL_TREASURY_ADDRESS=rYourTreasuryAddress

# RLUSD (optional — enables RLUSD pay button)
XRPL_RLUSD_ISSUER=rRlusdIssuerAddress
# XRPL_RLUSD_CURRENCY=RLUSD
```

## Stripe (alternative #2 — card / fiat, not primary)

```bash
# Create a $18 Product in Stripe Dashboard → copy Price ID
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
STRIPE_PROTOCOL_PRICE_ID=price_...
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=  # optional — for server-side unlock webhooks later
```
